# PROJECT MASTER PROMPT: BIZSATHI
## Smart Business Management SaaS for Indian Small Businesses

### 1. Project Overview

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, SaaS architect, UI/UX designer, database architect, QA engineer, and DevOps engineer.

Build a complete, production-minded full-stack web application named **BizSathi**, designed to help Indian small business owners manage their daily business operations from one platform.

The platform should be suitable for retailers, wholesalers, distributors, electrical shops, hardware stores, mobile-accessory businesses, and other small businesses.

The objective is to build a working product that can be deployed publicly, tested by real users, included in a professional developer portfolio, and potentially monetized as a SaaS business.

Do not create only a static UI or demo dashboard. Implement real frontend-backend integration, persistent database storage, authentication, authorization, business logic, validation, error handling, and automated tests.

